      <div purpose="page-section" id="migration">
        <div purpose="section-with-image">
          <div purpose="feature-text">
            <h3>Migration: what most teams get wrong</h3>
            <p>Most teams never try. They assume switching means wiping every laptop and starting over in ABM. It doesn’t. You keep ABM, point your devices at Fleet, and Apple’s native MDM migration moves each Mac without a factory reset, so people keep working through it. Thumbtack moved more than 90% of its Macs with no help from IT. Migration support comes with the license, and a Fleet engineer who has done this before will handle the move with you.</p>
            <div purpose="section-buttons">
              <a purpose="cta-button" class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact?talkToUs">Get a demo</a>
              <animated-arrow-button href="/compare/jamf-vs-fleet">Fleet vs. Jamf</animated-arrow-button>
